December 21-23, Kobe, Japan, pp. 59-63.
2. Rakotondrajao, F. and Jangsamsi, K., 2019, "Road Boundary Detection for Straight Lane
Lines Using Automatic Inverse Perspective Mapping ", ISPACS 2019, December 3 -6,
Beitou, Taipei, Taiwan. pp.1-2. DOI: 10.1109/ISPACS48206.2019.8986330
3. Chotikawanida, P., Pramoun, T., Thongkor, K., Supasirisun, P. and Amornraksa, T., 2018,
