Evaluating Uniform and Nonuniform Lagrange and Newton Curves”, World Academy
of Science, Engineering and Technology , Open Science Index 152, International
Journal of Computer and Information Engineering, Vol. 13, No. 8, pp. 448 - 452.
2. Nuntawisuttiwong, T. and Dejdumrong, N., 2019, “ Monomial Form Approach t o
Rectangular Surface Modeling”, World Academy of Science, Engineering and
Technology, Open Science Index 152, International Journal of Computer and
Information Engineering, Vol. 13, No. 8, pp. 453 - 457.
